<speak>My <sub alias="eff eye en">FIN</sub> is <sub alias="gee">G</sub> six three seven six nine three eight <sub alias="ex">X</sub>. My date of birth is the twenty-third of July nineteen sixty-two. I have the relevant document beside me, so that part is straightforward. I used to keep everything in different drawers and then get irritated with myself when a call started. Now I prepare a little folder beforehand. It is not very sophisticated, just a plain folder with a sticky note on the front, but at least I do not spend the first few minutes opening cupboards and asking my husband where I left something.</speak>